[12.876165625,"o","\u001b[?2026h\u001b[1;35r\u001b[35;1H\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K  Over time, the pipe became one of Unix’s defining abstractions and spread to Unix-like systems, scripting languages,\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K  and operating systems influenced by Unix. Its impact is visible in modern shells, data-processing workflows, and even\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K  software architecture patterns that favor streams and composition. The history of Unix pipes is therefore not only the\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K  story of one operating-system feature, but of a broader design philosophy: simple interfaces make complex systems\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K  easier to build.\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b[r\u001b[38;3H\u001b[36;2H\u001b[0m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[37;2H\u001b[0m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[38;36H\u001b[0m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[39;2H\u001b[0m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[40;44H\u001b[0m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b[0 q\u001b[?25h\u001b[38;3H\u001b[?2026l"]
